# clash — example pack that demonstrates the `#meta:conflicts` gate. It declares
# a conflict with `cowsay` (a member of the `demo` pack), so installing `clash`
# while `demo` is installed is refused BEFORE any pacman transaction runs —
# proving conflict safety (no half-applied state). With `demo` absent it installs
# normally. Its own member is a tiny official-repo CLI (never baked).
#meta:type example
#meta:conflicts cowsay
figlet
